# mole — pokes out of the ground, sniffs, vanishes
sprite mole
tags creature ground tiny mammal burrow
anchor 8 10
palette
  m 3a2c22 ~6
  l 2a2018 ~4
  L 1c1610 ~3
  b 3a3a40 ~4 z+1
  a 26262c ~3 z+1
  d 16161a ~2 z+1
  p b07a74 z+2
  q 8a5a56 z+2
  P c08e86 z+2
end

